[act "warm, casual, conversational"]

lin: [lang zh|这边有四个座位！喝点什么？今天我请。] [pause 180ms]
james: [lang en|A latte for me. And that cake looks way too good to ignore.] [pause 180ms]
haru: [lang ja|じゃあ、ケーキはみんなで分けよう。写真も撮りたいな。] [pause 180ms]
mina: [lang ko|좋아! 사진은 내가 찍을게. 잠깐, 아직 먹지 마!] [pause 160ms]
lin: [act "playfully defensive"] [lang zh|哎，别看我，我只是帮蛋糕调整一下角度。] [pause 220ms]
james: [act "gently teasing"] [lang en|With a fork? Sure. Very artistic.] [pause 200ms]
